 berubah</span></p>\r\n', 'desain', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 8),
(98, 'KARTU NAMA (indigo)', '<p>	1. Pastikan jumlah order Name Card.<br />	2. Tentukan format lay out name card (potong kotak/potong rounded).<br />	3. Cek ukuran jadi name card. Misalnya 90x50 mm.<br />	4. Lebarkan background, misalnya menjadi 93x58 mm. Setting name card di program CorelDraw.</p><p>	<img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/bleed%20kartu%20nama.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 396px;\" /></p><p>	<br />	5. Pastikan jarak konten (khususnya teks &amp; logo) dengan pisau minimal 5mm.<br />	6. Buat satu desain Name Card yg sudah dilebarin (93x58 mm), dan canvas corel tetap ukuran 90x55 mm.&nbsp;<br />	7. Repeat desain dgn cara: Ctrl + P ---&gt; (sesuaikan dialogue box spt berikut):</p><p>	<img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/preferance%20kartu%20nama.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 383px;\" /></p><p>	<br />	8. Lalu Klik &quot;Print Preview&quot;, dan akan muncul spt ini:</p><p>	<img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/duplikasi%20kartu%20nama.jpg\" style=\"width: 900px; height: 692px;\" /></p><p>	<img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/preview%20kartu%20nama(1).jpg\" style=\"width: 900px; height: 693px;\" /></p><p>	&nbsp;</p><p>	9. Jika sudah seperti tampilan di atas (21 mata), klik toolbar &quot;print&quot;, sampai selesai muncul file PDF nya.<br />	10. Print dummy ukuran sebenarnya, cek kelayakan teks dan gambar.<br />	11. Print dummy fit to A4.<br />	12. Selesai</p><p>	Tampilan Settingan Kartu nama yg sudah jadi (PDF)</p><p>	<img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/kartu%20nama%20Fani%20Jayanti%20%26%20Melissa%20Juwono.jpg\" style=\"width: 1000px; height: 726px;\" /></p><p>	Potong bulat &nbsp;86 x 54 cm</p><p>	potong kotak 90 x 55 cm</p><p>	&nbsp;</p><p>	&nbsp;</p>', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3),
(99, 'JUMLAH PRODUKSI (ORDER + INSHEET)', '<p>	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Perhitungan jumlah Produksi (Jumlah order + insheet)</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Alur Proses Panjang (misalnya:&nbsp;Cetak - dof - pond - finishing)</span></span></p><p>	<font class=\"Apple-style-span\" face=\"\'trebuchet ms\', helvetica, sans-serif\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/Proses%20panjang.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 55px; \" /></font></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Alur Proses Pendek (misalnya: Cetak - dof - pond)</span></span></p><p>	<font class=\"Apple-style-span\" face=\"\'trebuchet ms\', helvetica, sans-serif\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/Proses%20pendek.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 55px; \" /></font></p><p>	&nbsp;</p><p>	&nbsp;</p>', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3),
(100, 'KOMPOSISI CETAK BLACK', '<p>\r\n	Bandung, Black (hitam) ketika nanti di cetak harus memenuhi komposisi:</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	C &nbsp;= &nbsp;60 %</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	M &nbsp;= &nbsp;0&nbsp;%</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Y &nbsp;= &nbsp;30&nbsp;%</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	K &nbsp;= &nbsp;100&nbsp;%</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Jakarta, Black (hitam) ketika nanti di cetak harus memenuhi komposisi:</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	C &nbsp;=&nbsp; 50%</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	M &nbsp;=&nbsp; 50%</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Y &nbsp;=&nbsp; 50%</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	K &nbsp;= &nbsp;100&nbsp;%</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	update : 20 Nov 2013</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3),
(101, 'ISTILAH CETAK', '<p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Ada 4</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">1. &nbsp;1 Muka</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cetak dengan satu sisi, menggunakan 1 film (1 plat) untuk 1 warna, 4 film untuk full colour.</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/1%20film.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 342px; \" /></span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">2. &nbsp;BBS</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Cetak dengan dua sisi, menggunakan 1 film (1 plat) untuk 1 warna, 4 film untuk full colour.</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Balik kertas (portrait) dengan poros horizontal.</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/BBS.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 342px; \" /></span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">3. &nbsp;BBB</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Cetak dengan dua sisi, menggunakan 1 film (1 plat) untuk 1 warna, 4 film untuk full colour.</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Balik kertas (portrait) dengan poros vertikal.</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/BBB.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 342px; \" /></span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">4. &nbsp;8 Plat (Bolak balik ganti plat).</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Cetak dengan 2 sisi (bolak balik), menggunakan 2 film (2 plat)</span></span></p><p>	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb//images/2%20film.jpg\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 346px; \" /></span></span></p>', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3),
(102, 'FOOD BOX, UNDANGAN, DLL KONDISIONAL PRODUK', '<p>	&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">1. Pastikan bentuk &amp; ukuran produk (box/undangan)</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">2. Jarak konten teks dengan pisau minimal = 5mm.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">3. Tambahkan luas background di tiap sisi, minimal = 3 mm.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">4. Buat satu desain, lalu repeat desain sesuai banyaknya order.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">5. <strong>Optimalkan posisi setting dengan plano.</strong> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Misalnya produk berbentuk + akan lebih efisien dengan setting bentuk x.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Atau bentuk memanjang tak beraturan akan lebih efisien dengan setting miring 30 derajat.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">6. Setting BBS (jika bolak balik).</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">7. Buat cross potong.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">8. Buat cross sudut.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">9. Buat cross warna di luar konten (jika full colour).</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">10. Save as menjadi&nbsp;<span class=\"font5\">undangan_set.cdr</span><span class=\"font0\">&nbsp;di folder&nbsp;</span><span class=\"font5\">Post Set</span><span class=\"font0\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">11. Print ukuran sebenarnya, cek kelayakan teks dan gambar.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">12. Print dummy BW (black white)/ FC (full colour), fit to A4.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">13. Jika OK, jadikan curve. Atau copy font.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">14. Tulis ukuran film pada sudut kanan atas dummy. Misalnya ukuran film menjadi 305 x 430 mm.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Tulis juga ukuran film pada nama file. Contoh&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 11px; \"><strong style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; font-size: 17px; \">undangan_film420x290mm.cdr</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<span style=\"font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva; font-size: small; \">15. Selesai &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<font class=\"Apple-style-span\" face=\"\'trebuchet ms\', geneva\" size=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/kemasan%20final.jpg\" style=\"width: 1071px; height: 1200px; \" /></font></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	<font class=\"Apple-style-span\" face=\"\'trebuchet ms\', geneva\" size=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/project/pb/gambar/images/undangan%20final%202.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 800px; \" /></font></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \">	&nbsp;</p>', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3),
(103, 'BUKU TABUNGAN', '<p>\r\n	Tambahkan desain masing2 sisi 5mm.</p>\r\n', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3),
(105, 'JO Brataco (ETIKET STIKER)', '<p>\r\n	<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">ETIKET STIKER</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Order Etiket Stiker Brataco merupakan order tetap, sehingga desain dan bahan pun akan selalu sama.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Perhitungan yg ada berdasarkan jumlah order saja. Contoh File:<strong> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\\rutin\\brataco\\etiket\\final 4 sept 09.cdr</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Film file ukuran <strong>36x31 cm</strong>.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Ada dua macam bahan yg selalu digunakan</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">1. Stiker Lintek HVS 70x109 cm</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 1 plano jadi 6 bagian, potong 35x36 cm. 1 area cetak (31x35.5) jadi 2 lembar etiket</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Project : ukuran 31 x 36 cm, bahan stiker lintek hvs, cetak 3 warna (hitam,biru dan merah), pond 1/2 tembus pisau L5</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">2. HVS Double Folio HVS100 gr, 42x33 cm</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Untuk bahan ini tidak perlu potong. 1 double folio = 1 cetakan. Sesuaikan dengan jumlah settingan.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Projec t: area cetak 31 x 36 cm, kertas hvs 100gr, cetak 3 warna (hitam,biru dan merah), porporasi , pisau L4</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Contoh:</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<font class=\"Apple-style-span\" face=\"\'trebuchet ms\', helvetica, sans-serif\">Order: masing-masing 2500 pcs</font></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	jadi:</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Stiker Lintek HVS</span></span></strong>, bahan = <strong>240</strong> plano, insheet 380</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">HVS Double Folio HVS, </span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">bahan </span></span>= <strong>3 rim</strong> double folio, insheet 500</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Catatan:</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	untuk cetak berikutnya, lihat sisa produksi sebelumnya. Jika ada sisa (misalnya 200 pcs),</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	maka untuk insheet dikurangi sisa tersebut (380-200= 180 pcs = 90 cetak = 15 plano)</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Begitu seterusnya..</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	_______________________________________________________________________________</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	STIKER PENANDAAN (update 12 Juli 2013)</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Project:</p>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"tablex\" width=\"100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n				stiker penandaan</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n				bahan korosif&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n				2.000</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n				900</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n				lainnya:ukuran 17 x 35 cm, stiker chromo, cetak 2 warna, pond 1/2 tembus &nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"tablex\" width=\"100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"zebra\">\r\n			<td>\r\n				stiker penandaan</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n				bahan berbahaya</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n				1.000</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n				900</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n				lainnya::ukuran 17 x 35 cm, stiker chromo, cetak 2 warna, pond 1/2 tembus &nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n	Stiker chromo 108x70 cm, potong jadi 10, ukuran potong 21,6x35 cm, area cetak 17x30 cm.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	file terakhir di sini W:\\brataco\\penandaan\\post set</p>\r\n', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3),
(106, 'CARA CEK KELAYAKAN IMAGE, UTK FILE COREL EXPORT PDF', '<p>\r\n	1. Buka file asli Corel, dan file yg sudah di export PDF.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	2. zoom 1 image tertentu yg ada di corel</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	3. Klik Menu Bitmap, pilih Convert to Bitmap.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp; &nbsp; Pada menu pilih DPI = 300</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	4. Bandingkan image bitmap (Corel) dengan image di file PDF.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	5. Jika image sama maka, file image PDF layak untuk cetak.</p>\r\n', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3),
(107, 'JO CD LABEL & COVER DVD', '<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Stiker label CD/DVD</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">1. Ukuran Label 130x251 mm.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">2. diameter luar (besar) 117 mm, diameter dalam (kecil) 17 mm.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">3. jarak antara dua diameter luar = 5 mm.</span></span></p>\r\n', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3),
(108, 'JO BOX BEBEK GARANG', '<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">ATAS</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Ukuran file &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 494x244 mm, 1 file, 2 tutup box</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Bahan &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= duplex 310 108x79 cm</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">potong jadi 6, ukuran = 50x26 cm</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">BAWAH</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Ukuran file &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 342x342 mm, 1 file, 1 box</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Bahan &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = duplex 310, 108x79 cm</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">potong jadi 6, ukuran &nbsp;= 36x39,5 cm</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Biasanya Order selalu 8000 pcs</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">ATAS: bahan 720 plano, 1 plano dapat 12 tutup box. Total dapat 8640 tutup box</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,helvetica,sans-serif;\">BAWAH: bahan 1440 plano, 1 plano dapat 6 box bawah.&nbsp;Total dapat 8640 bawah box</span></span></p>\r\n', 'setting', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 3);
